<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT AUSTRALIA BY FOUR WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT AUSTRALIA BY FOUR WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan beat Australia by four wickets in their limited-overs World Series cricket match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores - Australia 199 all out in 47.1 overs; Pakistan 203 for six in 45.3 overs (Ijaz Ahmed 58, Aamir Sohail 52).</p>
